'' RUN: 'match' evaluation (RFC-0001-match 5.5): the subject once in both forms; a failed guard
'' falls through; a match expression in a single-line IF and two in one statement; a nested match
'' in an arm's value using the outer binding; string and UDT results; an enum holding no member's
'' value runs no arm and the value form gives its last arm; a binding aliases the copy; a match
'' inside a generic, instantiated twice.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -w all tests/codegen/src/match-eval.tiko -o tests/codegen/matcheval.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: warning
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/matcheval.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/matcheval.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: once: 10 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: stmt:2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: stmtcalls: 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: guard:odd big
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: sl:seven
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: two:ac
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: nest:step
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: strres:red!green
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: udtres: 1 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: oddv: 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: copy: 50 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: generic:int|str
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: done
